\li1 \w The leader|strong="H05387"\w* \w of the Reubenites|strong="H01121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H07205"\w* \w is Elizur|strong="H00468"\w* \w son|strong="H01121"\w* \w of Shedeur|strong="H07707"\w*, \v 11 \w and his division|strong="H06635"\w* \w numbers|strong="H06485"\w* \w 46,500|strong="H08337"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00705"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00505"\w* \w . . .|strong="H02568"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03967"\w*.
\li1 \v 12 \w The tribe|strong="H04294"\w* \w of Simeon|strong="H08095"\w* \w will camp|strong="H02583"\w* \w next to it|strong="H05921"\w*. \w The leader|strong="H05387"\w* \w of the Simeonites|strong="H01121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H08095"\w* \w is Shelumiel|strong="H08017"\w* \w son|strong="H01121"\w* \w vvv|strong="H06701"\w* \w of Zurishaddai|strong="H06701"\w*, \v 13 \w and his division|strong="H06635"\w* \w numbers|strong="H06485"\w* \w 59,300|strong="H08672"\w* \w . . .|strong="H02572"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00505"\w* \w . . .|strong="H07969"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03967"\w*.
\li1 \v 14 \w [Next will be] the tribe|strong="H04294"\w* \w of Gad|strong="H01410"\w*. \w The leader|strong="H05387"\w* \w of the Gadites|strong="H01121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01410"\w* \w is Eliasaph|strong="H00460"\w* \w son|strong="H01121"\w* \w of Deuel|strong="H07467"\w*,\f + \fr 2:14 \ft Many MT manuscripts, SP, and Vulgate (see also Numbers 1:14); most MT manuscripts \fqa Reuel\f* \v 15 \w and his division|strong="H06635"\w* \w numbers|strong="H06485"\w* \w 45,650|strong="H02568"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00705"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00505"\w* \w . . .|strong="H08337"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03967"\w* \w . . .|strong="H02572"\w*.
\pmo \v 16 \w The total|strong="H03605"\w* \w number of men|strong="H06485"\w* \w in the divisions|strong="H06635"\w* \w of the camp|strong="H04264"\w* \w of Reuben|strong="H07205"\w* \w is 151,450|strong="H03967"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00505"\w*; \w . . .|strong="H00259"\w* \w . . .|strong="H02572"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00505"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00702"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03967"\w* \w . . .|strong="H02572"\w* \w they shall set out|strong="H05265"\w* \w second|strong="H08145"\w*.
\p \v 17 \w In the middle|strong="H08432"\w* \w of the camps|strong="H04264"\w*, \w the Tent|strong="H00168"\w* \w of Meeting|strong="H04150"\w* \w is to travel|strong="H05265"\w* \w with the camp|strong="H04264"\w* \w of the Levites|strong="H03881"\w*. \w They are to set out|strong="H05265"\w* \w in the order|strong="H00834"\w* \w they encamped|strong="H02583"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H03651"\w* \w each|strong="H00376"\w* \w in|strong="H05921"\w* \w his own place|strong="H03027"\w* \w under his standard|strong="H01714"\w*.
\p \v 18 \w On the west side|strong="H03220"\w*, \w the divisions|strong="H06635"\w* \w of Ephraim|strong="H00669"\w* \w are to camp|strong="H04264"\w* \w under their standard|strong="H01714"\w*:
