\s1 Confession and Restitution
\r (Luke 19:1–10)
\p \v 5 \w And the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w said|strong="H01696"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w Moses|strong="H04872"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00559"\w*, \v 6 “\w Tell|strong="H01696"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w* \w the Israelites that|strong="H01121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03478"\w* \w when|strong="H03588"\w* \w a man|strong="H00376"\w* \w or|strong="H00176"\w* \w woman|strong="H00802"\w* \w acts|strong="H04603"\w* \w unfaithfully|strong="H04604"\w* \w against the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w by committing|strong="H06213"\w* \w any|strong="H03605"\w* \w sin|strong="H02403"\w* \w against another|strong="H00120"\w*, \w that|strong="H01931"\w* \w person|strong="H05315"\w* \w is guilty|strong="H00816"\w* \v 7 \w and must confess|strong="H03034"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the sin|strong="H02403"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w he has committed|strong="H06213"\w*. \w He must make full restitution|strong="H07725"\w*, \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w -|strong="H00817"\w* \w . . .|strong="H07218"\w* \w add|strong="H03254"\w* \w a fifth|strong="H02549"\w* \w to its value|strong="H05921"\w*, \w and give all this|strong="H05414"\w* \w to the one|strong="H00834"\w* \w he has wronged|strong="H00816"\w*.
