ong="H00853"\w* \w to the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w one|strong="H00259"\w* \w as a sin offering|strong="H02403"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w and the other|strong="H00259"\w* \w as a burnt offering|strong="H05930"\w*, \w to make atonement|strong="H03722"\w* \w for|strong="H05921"\w* \w the Levites|strong="H03881"\w*.
