\s1 The Complaint of Miriam and Aaron
\p \v 1 \w Then Miriam|strong="H04813"\w* \w and Aaron|strong="H00175"\w* \w criticized|strong="H01696"\w* \w Moses|strong="H04872"\w* \w because of|strong="H05921"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00182"\w* \w the Cushite|strong="H03569"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w woman|strong="H00802"\w* \w he had married|strong="H03947"\w*, \w for|strong="H03588"\w* \w he had taken|strong="H03947"\w* \w a Cushite|strong="H03569"\w* \w wife|strong="H00802"\w*. \v 2 “\w Does the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w speak|strong="H01696"\w* \w only|strong="H07535"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00389"\w* \w through Moses|strong="H04872"\w*?” \w they said|strong="H00559"\w*. “\w Does He not|strong="H03808"\w* \w also|strong="H01571"\w* \w speak|strong="H01696"\w* through us?” \w And the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w heard this|strong="H08085"\w*.
