\p \v 21 \w So they went up|strong="H05927"\w* \w and spied out|strong="H08446"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w from the Wilderness|strong="H04057"\w* \w of Zin|strong="H06790"\w* \w as|strong="H05704"\w* \w far as Rehob|strong="H07340"\w*, \w vvv|strong="H00935"\w* \w toward Lebo-hamath|strong="H02574"\w*. \v 22 \w They went up|strong="H05927"\w* \w through the Negev|strong="H05045"\w* \w and came|strong="H00935"\w* \w to|strong="H05704"\w* \w Hebron|strong="H02275"\w*, \w where|strong="H08033"\w* \w Ahiman|strong="H00289"\w*, \w Sheshai|strong="H08344"\w*, \w and Talmai|strong="H08526"\w*, \w the descendants|strong="H03211"\w* \w of Anak|strong="H06061"\w*, \w dwelled|strong="H02275"\w*. \w It had been built|strong="H01129"\w* \w seven|strong="H07651"\w* \w years|strong="H08141"\w* \w before|strong="H06440"\w* \w Zoan|strong="H06814"\w* \w in Egypt|strong="H04714"\w*.
\p \v 23 \w When they came|strong="H00935"\w* \w to|strong="H05704"\w* \w the Valley|strong="H05158"\w* \w of Eshcol|strong="H00812"\w*,\f + \fr 13:23 \fqa Eshcol \ft means \fqa cluster\ft ; also in verse 24.\f* \w they cut down|strong="H03772"\w* \w . . .|strong="H08033"\w* \w a branch|strong="H02156"\w* \w with a single|strong="H00259"\w* \w cluster|strong="H00811"\w* \w of grapes|strong="H06025"\w*, \w which they carried|strong="H05375"\w* \w on a pole|strong="H04132"\w* \w between two men|strong="H08147"\w*. \w They also took some|strong="H04480"\w* \w pomegranates|strong="H07416"\w* \w . . .|strong="H04480"\w* \w and figs|strong="H08384"\w*. \v 24 \w Because of|strong="H05921"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00182"\w* \w the cluster|strong="H00811"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w of grapes the Israelites|strong="H01121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03478"\w* \w cut|strong="H03772"\w* \w there|strong="H08033"\w*, \w that|strong="H01931"\w* \w place|strong="H04725"\w* \w was called|strong="H07121"\w* \w the Valley|strong="H05158"\w* \w of Eshcol|strong="H00812"\w*.
\s1 The Reports of the Spies
