\p \v 15 \w Then Moses|strong="H04872"\w* \w became very|strong="H03966"\w* \w angry|strong="H02734"\w* \w and said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*, “\w Do not|strong="H00408"\w* \w regard|strong="H06437"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w* \w their offering|strong="H04503"\w*. \w I have not|strong="H03808"\w* \w taken|strong="H05375"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03808"\w* \w one|strong="H00259"\w* \w donkey|strong="H02543"\w* from them \w or mistreated|strong="H07489"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w a single|strong="H00259"\w* one of them.”
