\p \w From the wilderness [the Israelites went on]|strong="H04057"\w* \w to Mattanah|strong="H04980"\w*, \v 19 \w and from Mattanah|strong="H04980"\w* \w to Nahaliel|strong="H05160"\w*, \w and from Nahaliel|strong="H05160"\w* \w to Bamoth|strong="H01120"\w*, \v 20 \w and from Bamoth|strong="H01120"\w* \w to the valley|strong="H01516"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w [in]|strong="H07704"\w* \w Moab|strong="H04124"\w* \w where the top|strong="H07218"\w* \w of Pisgah|strong="H06449"\w* \w overlooks|strong="H08259"\w* \w . . .|strong="H05921"\w* \w . . .|strong="H06440"\w* \w the wasteland|strong="H03452"\w*.\f + \fr 21:20 \ft Or \fqa Jeshimon\f*
\s1 The Defeat of Sihon
\r (Deuteronomy 2:24–37)
